{"id":"vod_sn_36883","vodId":"36883","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"甲铁城的卡巴内瑞","name_cn":"甲铁城的卡巴内瑞","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8200b89273729e225e3a32505578d9a7.jpg"},"summary":"一种名为“卡巴内”的钢铁怪物忽然出现在人类社会之中，造成了巨大的恐慌。被它们袭击过的人类，会拥有起死回生之能力，并且亦开始袭击同类。在怪物猛烈的进攻之下，人类社会很快就四分五裂，幸存下来的人们建立起了城寨“驿”，靠着彼此互通有无苟且残存。驿与驿之间，唯一能够通行的交通工具是装甲蒸汽机车。生驹（畠中祐 配音）是一名以蒸汽锻冶为业的热血少年，他发明了武器“贯筒”，希望能够为消灭卡巴内贡献出自己的力量。一次偶然中，生驹邂逅了神秘的少女（千本木彩花 配音），与此同时，一场暴走事件的发生使得生驹所生活的显金驿彻底沦陷，卡巴内不断的产生着，生驹并没有选择逃跑，而是拿起武器，挺身而出。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qy0zEUJnT91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kcyh8jcXMs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HDZpMrbRkm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vdgD0kKq5z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/az6P0eRnJG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sHFe3t1mSV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6MDphuN3YP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Lb9gdAv9j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9NajGAsiEX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fWcWarbCe21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zua26HGDzR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qRRmc1LaRk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:17.670Z"}